  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the line-break rules used by a line-break configuration.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para><see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakStyle.Unspecified" /> leaves an existing style unchanged during a merge. <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakStyle.Auto" /> is an explicit choice that lets the platform select rules from the text's locale. These values have different merge behavior.</para>
      <para><see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakStyle.NoBreak" /> suppresses normal automatic breaks, but grapheme-based breaks can still occur to prevent clipping.</para>
      <para>This enum exposes the <c>LINE_BREAK_STYLE_*</c> constants from <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/graphics/java/android/graphics/text/LineBreakConfig.java">Android 16 LineBreakConfig</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
